{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：15:14 2026-06-21 HKT</p>\n\n<p>沙田沙角邨有人墮樓死亡。今日（21日）下午1時38分，綠鷺樓一名老翁墮樓，倒臥於天井位置。救護員到場，證實事主已當場死亡。警方正調查死者身份及事件原因。</p>\n<img alt=\"綠鷺樓一名老翁墮樓，警員接報到場。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c57603fb93e7811d0d6ec4113df5bc1/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_15_00_47_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"綠鷺樓一名老翁墮樓死亡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38d574577aaaaef6720c9f5b0e94ffa3/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_15_00_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5098ccd5238d0b771e0f626a934b8ada/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_15_00_46_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb041d31dda4e921499dec4bc7e92e3d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_15_00_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/754dce0b9b82d35bbea0726424b75a7c/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-21_at_15_00_45.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-21T07:39:11.068985+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}